{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 对人物心理动机和转折原因的交代不如 X 完整，尤其 S05、S07、S09，压缩后少了一些理解人物的关键连接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的关键词加亮、话与感受交替排列，以及感受随音乐到时出现，让观众更容易迅速抓住每段核心，也更容易把具体音乐变化转化为细腻的身体和情绪体验。X 的优势是心理叙述完整，人物为什么犹豫、害怕、重新放松以及前后态度如何变化，交代得更充分，整条故事线也更容易理解。综合而言，我选 Y，因为它在实际观看时的可扫读性、重点辨识和感受细节上优势更明显，但牺牲了一部分心理解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "155ab0a7-293e-41a5-9e7c-a045c77c83b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T162225444788Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:23:17.174565+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0bc9138e60e098b17a6e0cdba1fca7ad1e3df1d55f4f50b96ead91be7194f7d9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch